<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Overload-driven degradation" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_ADAPT> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A migration must not target an ineligible node or proceed when estimated time/cost exceeds configured limits and a local or degraded alternative better preserves continuity. The reason for abstention must be recorded." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#AbstentionPolicyType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyIdentifier> "P-ADAPT-04" .
