<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-05> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Separation of migration, delegation and federated learning" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_ADAPT> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every model or service degradation must record an explicit cause and link to the evaluation that triggered it and the action ultimately executed." .
