<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Degradation and executed-action recording" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_ADAPT> .
