<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "When delegation is chosen, the preferred destination must be the highest-trust candidate among those already satisfying load, availability, connectivity, residual capacity and active constraints. Its trust score need not exceed the source's if the source degradation has another cause." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
