<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Reference ReplicationEvent and SynchronizationEvent records must declare replicationVersion and idempotencyKey; the validation query must identify missing fields. This metadata contract does not guarantee exactly-once physical delivery, durable buffering or duplicate-free migration." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ADAPT-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ProhibitionPolicyType> .
