<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every temporary delegation must be materialized as an explicit event, not merely as a static relationship between nodes." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
