<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delegation as a semantic event" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_AUD> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every delegation must record the source, destination, cause, start of validity and recovery condition. Planned expiration must be stored separately; `validTo` is populated only when the delegation is effectively closed." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
