<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Temporal delegation content" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_AUD> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A delegation must close when its recovery condition is met or its planned expiration is reached. Closure must record `validTo` with the effective time and stop any new action based on the ended delegation." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
