<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Effective delegation closure" .
