<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A delegation chain must not exceed `D_delegation_max` or the equivalent stopping condition set in the acceptance profile/active policy." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ProhibitionPolicyType> .
