<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-04> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delegation cascade limit" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_AUD> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every relevant adaptive action must be justified by an identifiable MAPE-K symptom or condition and an applicable policy consistent with that symptom. Incompatibilities must be marked as violations or invalid evaluations." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
