<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-05> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Symptom–policy–action coherence" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_AUD> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every relevant `EvaluationState` must record, at minimum, the symptom, applied policies, contract, effective consent, evaluated alternatives, AHP scores, external trust criterion, selected tier, justification, decision time and a reference to the executed action." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
