<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Complete EvaluationState ticket" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_AUD> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Persisted information must allow retrospective reconstruction of the chain user → contract → effective consent → purpose → zone → policy → node state → alternatives/scores → trust → tier → action, identifying which values were valid at the decision time." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyIdentifier> "P-AUD-07" .
