<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyVersion> "POLICIES-REV-02" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-BUFFER-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-CONS-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-ZONE-01> .
