<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-05> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Retention at the highest authorized tier" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_DATA> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Low battery requires reduced model complexity and fewer non-critical transmissions. Critical battery requires attempting offloading only to an authorized tier with sufficient connectivity; if no authorized external option exists, local degradation and temporary retention must be applied." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyIdentifier> "P-DATA-06" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyVersion> "POLICIES-REV-02" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-ADAPT-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-BUFFER-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-DEVICE-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-07> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-27> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-06> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Policy> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Energy management for processing and transmission" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_DATA> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Pending flows must not resume merely because connectivity returns. Synchronization or transmission may restart only when sufficient connectivity, effective authorization, an eligible destination and compatible energy conditions hold simultaneously." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#AbstentionPolicyType> .
