<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-NODE-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TX-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-26> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-27> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-12> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-13> .
