<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-07> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Safe transmission and reconnection window" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_DATA> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Accidental duplicates or data marked as redundant without a replication purpose must not enter external flows. Controlled replicas are allowed only when explicitly identified, versioned and synchronized idempotently." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ProhibitionPolicyType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyIdentifier> "P-DATA-08" .
