<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-REPL-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TX-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-19> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-28> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-13> .
