<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#policyVersion> "POLICIES-REV-02" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-BUFFER-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TX-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-27> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-28> .
