<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-09> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Criticality-based prioritization" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_DATA> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Data used beyond their immediate observation must retain the minimum context needed to interpret their use: time, location or applicable zone, signal quality, device state, node state, processing level and purpose." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
