<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-DATA-10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Minimum processed-data context" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_FL> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A federated session must not start while any required participant fails the eligibility, trust or authorization conditions applicable to the flow. If conditions can recover, the session must be deferred to a valid window." .
