<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "No parameter, personalized model or gradient may be sent to higher tiers if effective authorization, the zone or privacy policies do not permit that flow type." .
