<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#recommendedMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-ZONE-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relatedRequirement> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RF-21> .
