<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Upstream federated-flow authorization" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_FL> .
