<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Improved models distributed to lower tiers must not include personal data, raw observations, individualized gradients or persistent user-derived identifiers. The flow must respect the contract, zone and active policies." .
