<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-07> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Minimum HFL session metadata" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_FL> .
