<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-08> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Model versioning and rollback" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_GOV> .
