<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Unique policy typing" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_GOV> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Governance evidence in the reference graph must expose governedBy for semantic contracts and appliedPolicy for evaluations with actions. Missing action-evaluation or evaluation-policy links must be reported. Other declared mechanisms are not evidence of runtime enforcement." .
