<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-INT-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-INT-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Semantic representation and querying must use open standards compatible with RDF/OWL/Turtle and SPARQL 1.1. An applicable standard vocabulary, including SOSA/SSN, SAREF, FOAF or GeoSPARQL, must be reused or aligned with; any conceptual duplication must be documented and justified." .
