<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-INT-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Extensibility without breaking the conceptual core" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_MODEL> .
