<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "The system must select the most suitable tier among eligible alternatives, not the highest tier by default. The decision must first apply hard constraints and then optimize among the remaining alternatives." .
