<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Selection by suitability, not highest tier" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_MODEL> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "When AHP is used, normalized weights must correspond to latency, privacy and model quality. Their sum must equal 1 within the configured tolerance. Trust is not part of this normalization." .
