<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "The trust score or trust weight must not be included as a fourth weight in AHP normalization. It may serve as a filter, ranking criterion or documented external adjustment after eligibility is established." .
