<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-05> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Every selection evaluation must retain the score of each evaluated candidate tier, the final selected tier and a justification explaining why the winning alternative outperformed the others." .
