<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "When privacy is the dominant criterion or effective consent limits aggregation, the decision must favor local or Edge tiers only if Edge remains authorized. A hard constraint always takes precedence over a quality score." .
