<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-06> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Privacy priority" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-07> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_MODEL> .
