<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-07> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conditional Cloud selection" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_MODEL> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "Prediction confidence, estimated error, local feedback and observed model quality must be recorded as independent evaluation metrics. AHP weights must not substitute for these metrics." .
