<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "For each supplied context in the controlled monitoring experiment, the policy engine must recompute the active rules and resulting monitoring plan and record its evaluation time. It must not reuse a previous context plan implicitly. Live context detection and model-reselection deadlines are outside this release." .
