<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-02> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Horizontal scaling compatible with Fog and Cloud" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_OPS> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A new Edge or Fog node must be able to register and enter evaluation without stopping the entire system and within the `T_node_join` limit set in the acceptance profile." .
