<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A failed or timed-out monitoring point must remain an explicit outcome. Under keep-going, subsequent independent points may execute according to the configured skip rules. This policy does not guarantee continuity of application services or durable synchronization during a physical failure." .
