<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-OPS-06> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "A supplied recovery context must be evaluated against its configured rules, producing a fresh monitoring plan rather than automatically restoring the largest resource set or shortest sampling interval. Per-item buffer-drain authorization and physical synchronization are outside this release." .
