<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#appliesToZoneType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RestrictedZone> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_ZONE> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "When processing originates in a restricted zone, user data and associated processing must not leave the local scope: Edge, Fog and Cloud are excluded. Receiving a generic model not derived from the user may be allowed only if an explicit zone policy authorizes inbound traffic and no user information is extracted." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ProhibitionPolicyType> .
