<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Restricted zone: local confinement" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#appliesInZone> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NorthRuralZone> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#appliesToZoneType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RuralZone> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#belongsToPolicyCategory> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyCategory_ZONE> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "In a rural zone, pending data must be retained locally by default and transmitted only during a safe window satisfying connectivity, energy, effective authorization and destination eligibility requirements." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#ObligationPolicyType> .
