<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "The presence of urban infrastructure does not itself authorize Edge/Fog aggregation or selection of higher tiers. Aggregation is permitted only when effective consent, the contract, active policy and destination eligibility allow it." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyType> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#AbstentionPolicyType> .
