<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-ZONE-04> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#hasPolicyStatement> "For a supplied reference zone assignment, validation must detect a selected external tier or recorded external transfer that violates restricted-zone confinement. This is a graph-validation policy; live mobility detection and automatic invalidation before physical transmission are future work." .
