<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CO> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "CO" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CO> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CO> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CO> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Policies overlap and can be satisfied simultaneously." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CO> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Consistent Overlap" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CON> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "CON" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CON> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CON> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Policies require incompatible effects in the same scope." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_CON> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contradiction / Direct Conflict" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_COR> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "COR" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_COR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_COR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_COR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Policies partially overlap with different effects in the intersection." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_COR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Correlation / Partial Conflict" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_DEP> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "DEP" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_DEP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_DEP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_DEP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One policy requires the result of another before evaluation/execution." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_DEP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Policy Dependency / Order Dependency" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_GEN> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "GEN" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_GEN> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_GEN> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_GEN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specific policy is an exception/restriction to a more general policy." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_GEN> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Generalization / Exception Conflict" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IND> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "IND" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IND> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IND> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
