<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IRR> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IRR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Policy cannot activate in any valid state or governs no reachable resource/action." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_IRR> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Irrelevance" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_RED> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "RED" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_RED> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_RED> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_RED> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One policy adds no observable effect beyond another." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_RED> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Redundancy" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SHD> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "SHD" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SHD> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
