<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SHD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A higher-priority policy makes another ineffective within the overlap." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SHD> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Shadowing / Override" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SUB> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#relationCode> "SUB" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SUB> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SUB> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SUB> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One policy scope is contained in another and adds compatible restrictions." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#PolicyRelationType_SUB> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Subsumption / Specialization" .
