<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#QueryCatalog_v3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#QueryCatalog_v3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The maintained queries/catalog.csv and queries/execution-plan.toml define 115 executable query contracts. Structural validation is complete; clinical acceptance and full policy coverage are not implied." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#QueryCatalog_v3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Validated SPARQL Query Catalog v3" .
