<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-08" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-08> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "The concurrency target must be expressed through the explicit value `N_agents` rather than ambiguous terms such as 'thousands of agents'; the load campaign must demonstrate concurrent operation with at least that number." .
