<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-09> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Onboarding a new Edge or Fog node must not require stopping the entire system, and the node must become available for evaluation within `T_node_join` after registration and validation are complete." .
