<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-11> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-11" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-11> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Query catalogue extensions must be introduced as versioned source changes that update the query inventory, routing plan, expectations and reference documentation together. The loader must reject inconsistent metadata; runtime insertion of arbitrary query identifiers is not supported." .
