<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-14> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Temporary delegation must limit propagation to a maximum depth of `D_delegation_max` or another explicit policy-defined stopping condition, preventing unbounded saturation cascades." .
