<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-17" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "There must be zero external transmissions of raw physiological observations and zero associations of direct personal identifiers with parameterized data, gradients or federated updates." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-CONS-02> .
