<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-06> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
