<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-17" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-18" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "The differential-privacy budget must be explicit and auditable for all applicable operations, including its links to purpose, contract and policy." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-FL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-18> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-18" .
