<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-19" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Anonymization, pseudonymization and differential-privacy mechanisms used by the system must be represented semantically or verifiably referenced from the corresponding session/flow, and must not depend solely on unlinked external documentation." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-FL-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-ID-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TX-01> .
