<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-19> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-19" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-20" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Adaptation policies must be configurable or versionable without modifying the ontology's central conceptual structure." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-04> .
