<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-20> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-20" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-21" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "When context, consent, contract, zone, connectivity or trust changes and the current selection becomes invalid, reevaluation must produce a new decision within `T_reselection_max`." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-CTX-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-04> .
