<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-21> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-21" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-22" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Constraint precedence must be deterministic: given the same states, contract, consent, zone and policy version, the system must produce the same eligibility decision and record the same applied precedence rule." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-CONS-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-22> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-ZONE-01> .
