<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-27> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-27" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-28" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "All MAPE-K decisions classified as relevant to adaptation must be represented by a complete `EvaluationState` as specified in RF-66." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-28> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-28" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-29" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Every tier selection must include a readable semantic justification, the evaluated alternatives and their scores, so that the decision can be explained without inferring missing information." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-06> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-29> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-29" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-30" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "A decision must be reconstructible retrospectively from persisted semantic information and its temporal relationships, without depending on external logs that are not linked to the model." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-02> .
