<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-30> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-30" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-31" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Every catalogue query must declare its inventory, report, review or violation kind and its interpretation expectation. Catalogue validation must preserve the distinction between warnings, violations and descriptive results." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-VAL-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-31> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-31" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-32" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "The trust score used in a decision must be queryable together with the version or historical window that produced it, enabling scientific reproducibility of node selection." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TRUST-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-NODE-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-NODE-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-32> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-32" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-33" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Given the same alternatives, metrics, AHP weights, consistency threshold and external trust criterion, the multicriteria decision result must be reproducible." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-AUD-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TRUST-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TRUST-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-07> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-NODE-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-33> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-33" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-34" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "AHP evaluations must satisfy weight normalization and the configured consistency threshold. If the mechanism does not use pairwise comparisons, the documentation and ontology must call it weighted multicriteria scoring rather than AHP." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-MODEL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-34> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-34" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-35" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "States must be modeled as first-class temporal entities and must be distinguishable from instantaneous observations or static values." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-05> .
