<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-35> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-35" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-36" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Every new state must record `validFrom`; when a state ends, it must record `validTo`, without reusing `validTo` for a planned expiration that differs from effective closure." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-CONS-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-DELEG-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-DELEG-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-AUD-03> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-CONS-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-36> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-36" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-37" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "The schema must provide derivedFrom from State to SOSA Observation so a supplied provenance assertion remains queryable after RDFS materialization. Missing source observations must not be fabricated; automatic provenance capture for every runtime metric is outside this release." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-TIME-01> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-37> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RNF-37" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#definedInArtifact> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RequirementsArtifact_Revised> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RNF-38" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Maintained ontology, policy and query changes must pass the release inventory, query expectations and regression checks. Changed semantic content must produce a different semantic digest and an explicit revision; incompatible schema or query contracts require a major-version migration. This does not certify arbitrary downstream extensions." .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-GOV-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-INT-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-MODEL-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToMechanism> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#M-VAL-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-FL-08> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-GOV-04> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-INT-02> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#tracedToPolicy> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#P-VAL-05> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#NonFunctionalRequirement> .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RNF-38> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#Requirement> .
