<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RV-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementIdentifier> "RV-02" .
<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RV-02> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "For violation queries, zero rows means compliance only after the dataset-loading, ontology-version, minimum-coverage and successful-execution checks defined in RF-71 have passed." .
