<http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#RV-03> <http://example.org/monitoringcontinuum#requirementStatement> "Experimental scenarios must be reproducible in Apache Jena Fuseki as the reference environment, loading the same versions of the TTL/dataset, policies, scenarios and queries. Other endpoints may additionally be used if they produce equivalent results for the reference battery." .
